From: Project Luma
Subject: [PATCH] profile: protect all management selectors on stdin

Shared bounded locked and cleared selector input for all management operations.
Reject embedded NUL, overlong input and lock failure before eUICC mutation.
The protected activation path receives the same bounded binary-safe handling.
Existing upstream argument forms remain available.

